test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0055643Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0056786Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0057586Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0058424Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0059225Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0060109Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0060940Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0061860Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0062601Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0063444Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0064336Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0065191Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0066594Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0067442Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0068100Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0068889Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0069808Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0070761Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0071527Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0072344Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0073199Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0073749Z                         processor works.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0074309Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0075381Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0076278Z                         parameters.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0076868Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0077567Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0078260Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0080948Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0081745Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0082914Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0083500Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0084135Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0084755Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0085343Z                         no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0085984Z     sqcircuit-lc        Run specified ideal LC with fixed eigenpair/reference
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0086589Z                         checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0087138Z     squadds-prior       Read a pinned offline WM1 frequency prior; no
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0087697Z                         simulation or network.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0088474Z     squadds-metadata    Execute pinned local metadata helpers; PRIOR_ONLY, no
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-22T02:17:30.0089098Z                         electrical validation.
